body:
This adds Python functions to get, set, and reset cuBLAS or cuBLASLt workspace sizes. Workspaces are updated lazily the next time they are accessed if the new workspace size is greater than the current size.

@ngimel, is this what you were hoping for? I believe the current BLAS backend can already be queried with `torch.backends.cuda.preferred_blas_library`.

cc @eqy

