review_comments.body:
I looked at `try_emplace` here, but I'm not convinced it's worth changing the existing code:

```c++
  NodeCall& lookup(const c10::intrusive_ptr<Node>& function) {
    auto [it, inserted] = try_emplace(function.get(), _next_id, function);
    if (inserted) {
      ++_next_id;
      nodes.emplace_back(function.get());
    }
    return it->second;
  }
```

