Hi @williamwen42 , thank you for the suggestion. 
I’ve refactored this by introducing a helper method _get_accelerator_device() in both HigherOrderOpTests and ActivationCheckpointingTests.
Created a helper method: 
def _get_accelerator_device(self):
    """Get current accelerator device, skip test if not available."""
    if not torch.accelerator.is_available():
        self.skipTest("Accelerator is not available")
    return torch.accelerator.current_accelerator()

All 8 test methods use this helper now. Thanks!

